Package: clipden
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ClipDen Maintainers <maintainers@clipden.org>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), wl-clipboard
Recommends: gnome-keyring
Homepage: https://github.com/clipden/clipden
Description: Linux desktop clipboard manager with Supabase cloud sync
 ClipDen is a lightweight Linux desktop application that automatically
 captures copied text, securely stores it in your Supabase PostgreSQL
 database, and provides fast search, editing, deletion, and retrieval.
